### Two things worth recording about the upstream

1. **The upstream repository ships no licence text.** Its `metadata.desktop`
   declares `X-KDE-PluginInfo-License=MIT`, which is the conventional KDE
   machine-readable assertion and is treated as the grant, but no MIT licence
   file was ever distributed with it.

2. **One upstream file was GPL-2.0-or-later, not MIT.**
   `package/contents/ui/config/IconPicker.qml` carries a GPL-2.0-or-later header
   (Copyright 2015 Martin Kotelnik). That file provided the themed icon chooser
   built on `KQuickAddons.IconDialog`, which no longer exists in Qt 6. It was
   **not** carried over into this port, so the GPL-2.0-or-later header does not
   travel with any part of this work. The replacement icon picker is original.

